infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title From JS/TS to Python
  desc The mental model transfers; the idioms do not
  compares
    - label Transfers — feels like home
      children
        - label Dynamic + interpreted
          desc Types live on values; errors at runtime, like JS
        - label A real REPL
          desc python / IPython / Jupyter — your console muscle
        - label First-class functions
          desc Pass them, return them, close over them
        - label Comprehensions ≈ map/filter
          desc [f(x) for x in arr] is the idiomatic form
    - label Different — trips you up
      children
        - label Indentation is the grammar
          desc No braces or semicolons; mis-indent is a syntax error
        - label None, not null/undefined
          desc One absence sentinel; test with is None
        - label Batteries included
          desc Check the huge stdlib before pip install
        - label venv + pip + PyPI + pyproject.toml
          desc Replaces node_modules + npm; create the venv first
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f59e0b
